{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>日常遇到比例、百分比或分數換算時，往往要翻出計算紙慢慢推導。Calculate Percentage PRO 把這類計算收進手機，只要輸入其中兩個數值，就能得出第三個答案，適合學生、財務與工程相關工作者使用。此工具原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-9.webp\">\n<h2>輸入兩個數值即得答案</h2>\n<p>開啟後只需在三個欄位中填入任意兩個數值，程式便按比例法則自動算出答案，並列出詳細解題步驟。分數與小數均可直接輸入，常數亦可代入；漏填或輸入有誤時，欄位會即時標示提醒。滑動或輕觸按鈕即可切換解答、輸入與紀錄，歷史紀錄可排序、刪除或一鍵清空，全程沒有廣告。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-383-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-384-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-385-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-386-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Calculate Percentage PRO</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:05.852886+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T07:32:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T23:18:08.093257+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:07.901200+00:00","content_hash":"1e07ceb9ee20589b93704612e00b64eee12109182f44a12c31d3c8fc5ae63a84","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}